  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why does the smallest bump leave such a big bruise",
      "char_file": "손등_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "As skin ages, the collagen",
        "that supports your skin",
        "and blood vessels breaks down",
        "",
        "On thin spots like the back",
        "of your hands, even a light",
        "bump can tear a vessel",
        "",
        "Most bruises like this fade",
        "within one to three weeks",
        "with no scar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Years of sun exposure",
      "char_file": "햇빛_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First, years of",
        "cumulative sun exposure",
        "",
        "Skin on the hands and",
        "forearms that's spent years",
        "in the sun loses collagen",
        "and grows thinner",
        "",
        "That leaves blood vessels",
        "with far less support"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instead of going unprotected",
      "char_file": "자외선차단제_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Cover your hands and",
        "forearms with long sleeves",
        "or sunscreen before",
        "you head outside",
        "",
        "Gloves or arm sleeves",
        "help too"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Blood thinners like aspirin",
      "char_file": "아스피린_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second, blood thinners",
        "like aspirin",
        "",
        "They make it harder for",
        "blood to clot, so once",
        "a vessel tears, it bleeds",
        "more before it stops",
        "",
        "That's why the bruise",
        "spreads so much larger"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instead of ignoring it",
      "char_file": "달력_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Keep track of the",
        "medications you're taking",
        "",
        "If bruising gets frequent",
        "or severe, check in",
        "with your doctor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dry skin left unmanaged",
      "char_file": "거미줄혈관_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Third, dry skin",
        "left unmanaged",
        "",
        "Dry skin loses",
        "its elasticity,",
        "so it absorbs",
        "even less impact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instead of letting skin dry out",
      "char_file": "바세린_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Moisturize your hands",
        "and arms every day",
        "",
        "A 12-week study found daily",
        "retinol cream thickened skin",
        "and boosted collagen"
      ]
    }
  ],
